{
  "$schema": "../../schemas/apps.schema.json",
  "comment": [
    "This is the app catalog for the whole tenant, not just the child tier. Required security and",
    "Microsoft 365 clients install automatically for the tier they target; other approved apps remain",
    "available in Company Portal but cannot be installed until declared here.",
    "Android entries are added through the Managed Google Play connector configured in the tenant.",
    "Windows entries use source=existing: Microsoft Store (new)/winget-backed apps cannot be created",
    "over Graph the way Managed Google Play and iOS Store apps can, so the app must be added once in",
    "the Intune admin center (Apps > Windows > Add > Microsoft Store app (new), searching the exact",
    "displayName below) before this repo can manage its assignment. Until then, deploy reports a",
    "harmless 'Prerequisite' action instead of failing."
